WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
In 1943 the Allies planned to invade Sicily.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Britain planted false papers with an invented officer identity.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
The documents pointed toward Greece and Sardinia.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The real man was Glyndwr Michael. Remember the person behind the deception.
